    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-43.t03",
      "en": "Leo does exercise in the morning to keep fit.",
      "es": "Leo hace ejercicio por la mañana para mantenerse en forma.",
      "explanationEs": "Do exercise, no «make exercise». Keep fit = mantenerse en forma.",
      "segments": [
