    },
    {
      "id": "en.n4.class-43.t04",
      "en": "I spend my free time at the park, and we always have fun.",
      "es": "Paso mi tiempo libre en el parque y siempre nos divertimos.",
      "explanationEs": "Spend time = pasar tiempo. Have fun = divertirse (make fun of alguien significa burlarse).",
      "segments": [
        "I spend my free time at the",
        "park, and we always have fun."
